# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 OR MIT
#
# A trailing `32` marks a function only the Pentium build imports, a trailing `64` one only the x86-64 build imports (the window-long
# calls are named differently there), and a trailing `collection` one only AGCOLLCT.SCR imports (it looks for AGQUILL.SCR beside itself,
# SAV-D29). Checked by hand against the Win32 reference's "Windows 95" column. No wide-character (...W) entry points.
